<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Sitix - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Sitix - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 49.27		vs	   36.11</p>
<p> Operating	    7.27		vs	    2.73</p>
<p> Current		5.87		vs	    2.43</p>
<p> Net		    3.08		vs	    1.14</p>
<p> EPS		   37.96 yen	  vs	   15.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares		90 million	 vs	   73 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Sitix Corp manufactures metallic titanium.</p>
